<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN THURSDAY SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN THURSDAY SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of play on the show courts on the fourth day of the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court (2345 GMT Wednesday start)</p>
<p>Lisa Raymond (U.S.) v 4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Adrian Voinea (Romania)</p>
<p>Grant Stafford (South Africa) v 5-Thomas Muster (Austria)</p>
<p>Night session (0800 GMT start)</p>
<p>15-Chanda Rubin (U.S.) v Sandrine Testud (France)</p>
<p>3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) v Karol Kucera (Slovakia)</p>
<p>Court One (2300 GMT Wednesday start)</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) v Hernan Gumy (Argentina)</p>
<p>Nicole Bradtke (Australia) v 9-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) v 14-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.)</p>
<p>Court Two (2300 GMT Wednesday start)</p>
<p>11-Jim Courier (U.S.) v Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) v Joannette Kruger (South Africa)</p>
<p>10-Albert Costa (Spain) v Jan Kroslak (Slovakia).</p>
</text>
